न काङ्क्षे विजयं कृष्ण न च राज्यं सुखानि च ॥ ३१ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":357,\"bb\":327,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/31/b327/\",\"body_value\":\"na ca śreyo ’nupaśyāmi
hatvā sva-janam āhave
na kāṅkṣe vijayaṁ kṛṣṇa
